### ── Get token (dev-only test endpoint) ──────────────────────────────────────
POST {{AUTH}}/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@locci.cloud",
  "password": "user123",
  "client_id": "locci-web"
}

### ── Unauthenticated: GET /users → expect 401 ───────────────────────────────
GET {{GW}}/users

### ── Unauthenticated: GET /products → expect 401 ───────────────────────────
GET {{GW}}/products

### ── Authenticated: GET /users → expect 200 ────────────────────────────────
GET {{GW}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### ── Authenticated: GET /products → expect 200 ─────────────────────────────
GET {{GW}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### ── Role enforcement: POST /products as user → expect 403 ─────────────────
POST {{GW}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Product abc",
  "price": 100.99
}

### ── Aggregation: GET /me → expect 200 with merged user + favourites ────────
GET {{GW}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
